<section class="comparison">

    <div class="container">

        <div class="comparison__eyebrow">
            <span>05</span>
            Direct vs. Woodara
        </div>

        <div class="comparison__header-content">

            <h3 class="comparison__title">
                Going straight to a factory looks cheaper. It rarely stays that way.
            </h3>

            <p class="comparison__description">
                Our sharpest edge isn't "we do everything" — independent benchmarking against 8 regional sourcing agencies puts Woodara clearly ahead on the two things that actually determine whether a project ships on time: turnkey installation and after-sales warranty response.
            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="comparison__table">

            <div class="comparison__column comparison__column--direct">

                <h5 class="comparison__heading">
                    Direct to one factory
                </h5>

                <ul class="comparison__list">

                    <li class="comparison__item">
                        <p>One quote, no benchmark — you don't know if it's fair</p>
                    </li>

                    <li class="comparison__item">
                        <p>Quality control depends on trusting the same factory that's paid to ship</p>
                    </li>

                    <li class="comparison__item">
                        <p>You coordinate customs, freight and installation yourself</p>
                    </li>

                    <li class="comparison__item">
                        <p>If a piece is wrong or damaged, you're negotiating alone</p>
                    </li>

                </ul>

            </div>

            <div class="comparison__column comparison__column--woodara">

                <h5 class="comparison__heading">
                    With Woodara
                </h5>

                <ul class="comparison__list">

                    <li class="comparison__item">
                        <p>Tendered across 7+ of our 450+ factories — you see the pricing spread before you commit</p>
                    </li>

                    <li class="comparison__item">
                        <p>Interim inspections and weekly reporting, independent of the factory</p>
                    </li>

                    <li class="comparison__item">
                        <p>Customs, freight and on-site installation handled end to end — 94% turnkey install score, the highest of any agency benchmarked</p>
                    </li>

                    <li class="comparison__item">
                        <p>A standing warranty desk — 93% after-sales rating, most competitors score under 10%</p>
                    </li>

                </ul>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>

<style>
    .comparison {
